stateDiagram-v2
    %% Elevator controller
    classDef moving fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
    classDef stopped fill:#f3f4f6

    [*] --> Idle:::stopped
    Idle --> MovingUp:::moving : call above
    Idle --> MovingDown:::moving : call below
    MovingUp --> DoorsOpen : arrived
    MovingDown --> DoorsOpen : arrived
    DoorsOpen --> Idle : timeout
    DoorsOpen --> DoorsOpen : obstruction

    style DoorsOpen fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
